1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,432
3 hours north of hoi an lies the important city of hue vietnams old imperial capital.
从会安向北约三小时，是重要城市顺化，越南过去的皇都。

2
00:00:07,432 --> 00:00:12,129
Since the 1800 s it's had an illustrious history primarily for being the home to.
作者说，从十九世纪起它便有显赫的历史，主要因为这里是……；字幕此处不完整，待听辨。

3
00:00:12,129 --> 00:00:24,555
The city is a lively one with a busy nightlife restaurants and cafes all sitting very comfortable amongst its historical roots which have not been forgotten.
这座城市有热闹夜生活、餐厅和咖啡馆，同时保留着没有被遗忘的历史根基。

4
00:00:24,555 --> 00:00:29,212
Those roots are on no better display than the imperial city.
皇城最能体现这些历史渊源。

5
00:00:29,212 --> 00:00:36,200
This whole citadel complete with its vast landscape palace grounds and gateways took 27 years to complete.
作者说，这整座城堡，连同大片园景、宫殿和城门，建了二十七年。

6
00:00:36,200 --> 00:00:41,158
And is one of the largest architectural complexes in all of vietnam.
他称这里是越南规模最大的建筑群之一。

7
00:00:41,158 --> 00:00:45,127
On approach the walls of this massive fortress are striking.
走近时，这座巨大堡垒的城墙令人印象深刻。

8
00:00:45,127 --> 00:00:49,784
The insides tell stories of those who both lived and died here.
里面讲述着曾在此生活、也在此离世的人们的故事。

9
00:00:49,784 --> 00:00:54,145
With only 10 major buildings remaining out of the original 160.
作者说，最初一百六十座主要建筑如今仅剩十座。

10
00:01:03,735 --> 00:01:12,628
Hue is surrounded by 7 royal tombs all elaborate resting places for the nguyen dynasty ruling from 1802 to 1945.
顺化周边有七座精美皇家陵墓，安葬的是作者所说的阮朝统治者，年代为 1802 至 1945。

11
00:01:12,628 --> 00:01:22,455
There are countless tours that visit these tombs with 2 of the most popular being ming manh and khai dinh.
有无数游览这些陵墓的行程，其中较受欢迎的两座是明命陵和启定陵。

12
00:01:22,455 --> 00:01:25,684
Minh mang was the second monarch of the nguyen dynesty.
作者介绍，明命是阮朝第二位君主。

13
00:01:25,684 --> 00:01:31,811
And was generally a well liked emperor due to his policies expanding and stabilising vietnam.
他认为这位皇帝因扩张和稳定越南的政策，普遍颇受好评。

14
00:01:31,811 --> 00:01:39,304
Covering 15 hectares it's easy to spend an hour here as the tomb and grounds still stand in great condition.
陵园占地十五公顷，很容易逛上一小时，墓园及周边保存状况良好。

15
00:01:46,495 --> 00:01:49,895
A short drive away is the tomb of khai dinh.
开车不远，就是启定陵。

16
00:01:49,895 --> 00:01:56,176
This is a much smaller tomb possibly reflecting that he was largely an unpopular emperor at the time.
这座陵墓小得多，作者推测，可能反映他当时不太受欢迎。

17
00:01:56,176 --> 00:02:01,849
Reigning during french rule he was generally perceived as a puppet with little actual power.
按作者介绍，他在法国统治时期执政，通常被视为没有多少实权的傀儡。

18
00:02:01,849 --> 00:02:11,895
Kie dinh was the countries second to last emperor ever with his successor ultimately abdicating thus ending the vietnamese monarchy in 1945.
作者说他是倒数第二位皇帝，继任者最终退位，越南君主制于 1945 年结束。

19
00:02:17,335 --> 00:02:20,871
Unlike hoi an hue felt much more lived in by its locals.
与会安不同，顺化更让作者感觉是当地人真实生活的城市。

20
00:02:20,871 --> 00:02:25,598
When we weren't peeking into its history we were seeking out its hospitality.
不窥探历史的时候，我们就去寻找它热情好客的一面。

21
00:02:25,598 --> 00:02:32,878
We rediscovered a vietnamese coffee that didn't involve a chicken and stuffed our mouths with some great food here.
重新喝到不加鸡蛋的越南咖啡，还大快朵颐，吃了不少好东西。

22
00:02:32,878 --> 00:02:40,195
The hotel we were staying in actually had its own spa which as you can see here we enjoyed thoroughly.
所住酒店还自带水疗中心，如画面所示，我们尽情享受了一番。

23
00:02:40,195 --> 00:02:44,183
These 2 days flew by and we were already packing for our final domestic flight.
两天飞快过去，我们已经在为最后一程国内航班打包。

24
00:02:44,183 --> 00:02:51,085
Which would take us to ho chi minh city vietnams most populated and forward looking city.
这趟航班将带我们去胡志明市，作者称其为越南人口最多、面向未来的城市。

25
00:03:09,504 --> 00:03:16,794
Especially after the relatively laid back hoi an and hue ho chi minh city was a bit of a shock to the system.
尤其在比较悠闲的会安和顺化之后，胡志明市的节奏让人有些不适应。

26
00:03:16,794 --> 00:03:21,194
As we had been sinking south the temperature had been climbing.
一路往南，气温也一路升高。

27
00:03:21,194 --> 00:03:25,916
Now hovering at 30 degrees this was double what we had in hanoi.
当时已接近三十度，是他们在河内所遇气温的两倍。
